35
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>nani wo mitsumete iru darou</b></font></font></font></font>

36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, Papa!</font>

38
00:01:41,330 --> 00:01:42,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Kunihisa?</font>

39
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:46,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, it's sparkly and pretty.</font>

40
00:01:46,370 --> 00:01:47,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, Kunihisa.</font>

41
00:01:50,630 --> 00:01:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though it's so pretty,
how can it have no value?</font>

42
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's horrible, isn't it, Papa?</font>

43
00:01:59,140 --> 00:02:05,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Impossible!</font>

44
00:01:59,140 --> 00:02:05,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Celeb Ninja
Technique</font>

45
00:01:59,140 --> 00:02:05,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">- Kinton Jutsu</font>

46
00:02:05,430 --> 00:02:08,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you serious, Grandma Tsunade!</font>

47
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:09,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down!</font>

48
00:02:11,060 --> 00:02:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, I'll calm down.</font>

49
00:02:17,990 --> 00:02:19,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since he is an important person,</font>

50
00:02:19,740 --> 00:02:21,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe there is no one better
for the job other than you.</font>

51
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:27,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Finally... Finally a mission
appropriate for my abilities.</font>

52
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:31,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guarding an important person...
It has such a nice ring to it!</font>

53
00:02:34,170 --> 00:02:35,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen closely!</font>

54
00:02:38,130 --> 00:02:38,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gotcha.</font>

55
00:02:41,090 --> 00:02:43,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, about this mission...</font>

56
00:02:44,010 --> 00:02:45,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Shizune.
— Yes!</font>

57
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:51,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The details are written in
those documents.</font>

58
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:54,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His name's Kunihisa,
he lives in the capital.</font>

59
00:02:54,690 --> 00:02:56,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's the heir of
an old acquaintance of mine.</font>

60
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:59,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your acquaintance, Grandma Tsunade?</font>

61
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:02,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, his father's name is Kunijiro.</font>

62
00:03:03,620 --> 00:03:06,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He made his fortune in one generation.
He's a successful jeweler.</font>

63
00:03:08,330 --> 00:03:10,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The heir of a jeweler...</font>

64
00:03:15,250 --> 00:03:16,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Papa?</font>

65
00:03:17,670 --> 00:03:19,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this real, too?</font>

66
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course it's real, little Kuni.</font>

67
00:03:22,590 --> 00:03:26,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, is that and that and this
and the one over there too?!</font>

68
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, little Kuni!</font>

69
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:31,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja! Ninja! Ninja!</font>

70
00:03:34,690 --> 00:03:37,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Suddenly my motivation is boosted!</font>

71
00:03:38,780 --> 00:03:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it! I'll do that mission!</font>

72
00:03:40,530 --> 00:03:43,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So where is this Kunihisa at,
Grandma Tsunade?!</font>

73
00:03:45,450 --> 00:03:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come in!</font>

74
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Ninja! Ninja! Ninja!
— Wow! Who's this brat?</font>

75
00:03:50,410 --> 00:03:52,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja! Ninja! Ninja! Ninja!</font>

76
00:03:53,170 --> 00:03:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja?</font>

77
00:03:55,290 --> 00:03:57,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't add that question
at the end of your sentence!</font>

78
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it must be you!</font>

79
00:04:00,170 --> 00:04:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are the kid who's going with Kunihisa
to play a Ninja for a day...</font>

80
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll leave him to you, then.</font>

81
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:11,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Be a Ninja for a day...?</font>

82
00:04:11,890 --> 00:04:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My little Kuni really admires Ninja,</font>

83
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:18,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and he aggravates me by saying
nothing but Ninja every day.</font>

84
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade!</font>

85
00:04:22,740 --> 00:04:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wasn't this
a guarding an important person mission?!</font>

86
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?</font>

87
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:29,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did say he's an important person,</font>

88
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:31,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but didn't say a word about
guarding him.</font>

89
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was fooled! Grandma!</font>

90
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

91
00:04:34,540 --> 00:04:38,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I order you to play be
a Ninja for a day with Kunihisa!</font>

92
00:04:39,050 --> 00:04:42,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... That's a dirty trick, Grandma!</font>

93
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:43,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, there's one more thing.</font>

94
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I added your regular missions
as a service.</font>

95
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:51,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that's cruel, Grandma Tsunade!</font>

96
00:04:56,850 --> 00:05:01,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clean the pond, repair the bridge,
get rid of the savage pig,</font>

97
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and...</font>

98
00:05:05,450 --> 00:05:09,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It turns out that babysitting is just
added to the regular D-rank missions!</font>

99
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:12,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja, Ninja.</font>

100
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:19,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watch this, Kunihisa!</font>

101
00:05:19,420 --> 00:05:21,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll teach you the awesomeness
of a Ninja.</font>

102
00:05:26,510 --> 00:05:30,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, awesome Naruto! Awesome!</font>

103
00:05:31,890 --> 00:05:34,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Be a Ninja for a Day day, isn't it?</font>

104
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Kunihisa, you gather garbage
from over there, too.</font>

105
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:38,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

106
00:05:38,900 --> 00:05:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that's right.
Don't go into the marsh.</font>

107
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:42,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This marsh is bottomless,</font>

108
00:05:42,690 --> 00:05:46,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so once you're caught,
you can't get out.</font>

109
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:47,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, what?</font>

110
00:05:48,530 --> 00:05:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Oh, no, Young Master is in trouble!
— Naruto!</font>

111
00:05:51,490 --> 00:05:53,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!</font>

112
00:05:53,490 --> 00:05:56,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fool! I'll save you,
so you stay right there!</font>

113
00:05:56,910 --> 00:05:58,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool! I'll be fine.</font>

114
00:05:58,880 --> 00:05:59,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be fine?</font>

115
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can handle this kind of simple task
with my Ninjutsu.</font>

116
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninjutsu?</font>

117
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Oh, no! Young Master!
— Oh, no!</font>

118
00:06:10,050 --> 00:06:12,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Alligator, Snapping Turtle, Piranha, Toad!</font>

119
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:14,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Money Style:</font>

120
00:06:15,810 --> 00:06:17,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Help Me Jutsu!</font>

121
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

122
00:06:19,810 --> 00:06:21,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mine!</font>

123
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?! Wha...?!</font>

124
00:06:31,910 --> 00:06:33,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm fine!</font>

125
00:06:36,450 --> 00:06:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you guys doing?!</font>

126
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want money,
hurry up and rescue me.</font>

127
00:06:46,590 --> 00:06:49,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What good would increasing
the victims do?</font>

128
00:06:55,310 --> 00:06:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Kunihisa.</font>

129
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:02,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are they?</font>

130
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, them...</font>

131
00:07:03,770 --> 00:07:09,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Papa employs them and
they protect me if I get into trouble.</font>

132
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:11,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really.</font>

133
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:14,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, for example...</font>

134
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

135
00:07:24,130 --> 00:07:24,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See!</font>

136
00:07:25,170 --> 00:07:27,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean "see"?!</font>

137
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:30,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it okay?</font>

138
00:07:30,300 --> 00:07:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said it's okay!</font>

139
00:07:32,970 --> 00:07:35,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really, really okay?</font>

140
00:07:35,850 --> 00:07:39,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you so freaked out about?
It's okay!</font>

141
00:07:40,690 --> 00:07:42,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But still, it's scary!</font>

142
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:45,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cut the bull and come here now!</font>

143
00:07:45,900 --> 00:07:46,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

144
00:07:47,570 --> 00:07:49,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But just before that...</font>

145
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:52,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Scapegoat Jutsu!</font>

146
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:59,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See? It's fine.
Come here, quick!</font>

147
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:04,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I get on it next,
I think it might break...</font>

148
00:08:04,500 --> 00:08:06,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's check out a bunch more.</font>

149
00:08:12,170 --> 00:08:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not finished yet! More of you!</font>

150
00:08:14,930 --> 00:08:15,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

151
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

152
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:30,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought.</font>

153
00:08:33,530 --> 00:08:34,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought I was gonna die.</font>

154
00:08:34,910 --> 00:08:37,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What were you doing, Kunihisa?!</font>

155
00:08:38,950 --> 00:08:41,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What would have happened
if I'd got on the bridge like that?</font>

156
00:08:42,710 --> 00:08:44,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on you!</font>

157
00:08:44,620 --> 00:08:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, everyone, your compensation!</font>

158
00:08:47,170 --> 00:08:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

159
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:51,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you, stop that!</font>

160
00:08:52,670 --> 00:08:56,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid...
He's got money, huh, Big Brother.</font>

161
00:08:56,430 --> 00:09:00,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... And his main guard
is a single Genin.</font>

162
00:09:00,970 --> 00:09:03,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big Brother, it's decided.</font>

163
00:09:04,390 --> 00:09:05,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

164
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's next?</font>

165
00:09:14,860 --> 00:09:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get rid of the savage pig
who appears in the field ahead.</font>

166
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:20,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! I'll do my best!</font>

167
00:09:21,870 --> 00:09:23,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

168
00:09:23,620 --> 00:09:25,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A savage pig...?</font>

169
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:28,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More like a monster!</font>

170
00:09:28,460 --> 00:09:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

171
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:30,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

172
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:33,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's cool!</font>

173
00:09:39,140 --> 00:09:39,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

174
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! It's my turn this time!</font>

175
00:09:44,020 --> 00:09:47,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool! What are you doing?
Hurry up and escape!</font>

176
00:09:49,650 --> 00:09:50,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

177
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:52,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Money Clone Jutsu!</font>

178
00:09:54,610 --> 00:09:55,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Money Clone?!</font>

179
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you ugly savage pig!</font>

180
00:10:02,990 --> 00:10:06,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Starting now,
I, Kunihisa, will punish you!</font>

181
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:09,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

182
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:15,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go! Get him! There!</font>

183
00:10:19,050 --> 00:10:24,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, nobody wants to eat your meat!
You dummy!</font>

184
00:10:34,530 --> 00:10:36,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He ordered all of this!</font>

185
00:10:36,190 --> 00:10:36,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

186
00:10:37,190 --> 00:10:40,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't want to,
but he forced me to...</font>

187
00:10:40,070 --> 00:10:41,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait...</font>

188
00:10:41,990 --> 00:10:43,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a lie. It's a misunderstanding!</font>

189
00:10:44,450 --> 00:10:46,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are false charges!</font>

190
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forgive me! Naruto...</font>

191
00:10:57,010 --> 00:10:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... How should I put this...?</font>

192
00:10:59,010 --> 00:11:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">really hate guys like you!</font>

193
00:11:02,090 --> 00:11:04,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you getting so testy?</font>

194
00:11:05,010 --> 00:11:08,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, poor people just can't help
that they have short tempers...</font>

195
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:14,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This'll put you back in a good mood.</font>

196
00:11:14,610 --> 00:11:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take as much as you want!</font>

197
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough already!</font>

198
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:20,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you to stop
doing stuff like that!</font>

199
00:11:20,450 --> 00:11:21,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

200
00:11:21,530 --> 00:11:24,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a big mistake to think that
anything can be resolved with money!</font>

201
00:11:24,450 --> 00:11:27,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are times when you have
to use your own power!</font>

202
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:31,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There hasn't been anything that
I couldn't do with money so far!</font>

203
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:35,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... Are you always like this?</font>

204
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:37,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With that personality,
you can't make friends!</font>

205
00:11:38,050 --> 00:11:40,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay 'cause
I can buy friends with money!</font>

206
00:11:40,970 --> 00:11:41,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

207
00:11:43,010 --> 00:11:45,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... Buy friends? You mean...</font>

208
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I give 'em money,
everybody will be my friend!</font>

209
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kunihisa...</font>

210
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:55,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I hate country Ninja.</font>

211
00:11:55,900 --> 00:11:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're cheap and stink of poverty...</font>

212
00:11:59,690 --> 00:12:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stupid!</font>

213
00:12:01,570 --> 00:12:05,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, please wait, Master Kunihisa!</font>

214
00:12:12,500 --> 00:12:14,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Running made me hungry.</font>

215
00:12:15,500 --> 00:12:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this and buy a boxed lunch!</font>

216
00:12:17,460 --> 00:12:19,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing like a store
to buy lunch around here.</font>

217
00:12:20,590 --> 00:12:21,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, snacks will be fine!</font>

218
00:12:22,220 --> 00:12:24,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no convenience store
or candy shop...</font>

219
00:12:24,890 --> 00:12:29,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're useless!
This is why I hate the country!</font>

220
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stupid Naruto.</font>

221
00:12:37,690 --> 00:12:38,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?</font>

222
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:40,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Young Master!</font>

223
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:47,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Little fish, little fish!</font>

224
00:12:48,660 --> 00:12:51,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's eat!</font>

225
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:55,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The kid must be stupid to get
caught in this cheap trick.</font>

226
00:12:55,370 --> 00:12:57,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Don't you agree, Bro?
— Yeah!</font>

227
00:13:08,180 --> 00:13:09,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto?!</font>

228
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:12,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aw man,
you're really high maintenance.</font>

229
00:13:12,730 --> 00:13:13,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those two guys just now...</font>

230
00:13:14,020 --> 00:13:15,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were going to catch you!</font>

231
00:13:17,150 --> 00:13:19,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were plotting a kidnapping,
whatever...</font>

232
00:13:20,730 --> 00:13:21,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever...?</font>

233
00:13:22,690 --> 00:13:25,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm often a target,
because I have money.</font>

234
00:13:25,780 --> 00:13:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Often a target...? You...</font>

235
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:31,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly,
I want to eat more fish!</font>

236
00:13:31,700 --> 00:13:33,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go find a shop and buy some.</font>

237
00:13:34,660 --> 00:13:38,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... Still think you can do
anything with money?</font>

238
00:13:40,210 --> 00:13:42,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, watch this!</font>

239
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:50,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Awesome! Awesome Naruto!</font>

240
00:13:51,100 --> 00:13:51,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How's that?!</font>

241
00:13:52,060 --> 00:13:56,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can just get things using
your own power without using money.</font>

242
00:13:57,940 --> 00:14:00,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even... without using money?</font>

243
00:14:03,190 --> 00:14:04,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

244
00:14:04,860 --> 00:14:06,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He attacked us by surprise,
that cowardly bastard.</font>

245
00:14:07,070 --> 00:14:08,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give it back to him double!</font>

246
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, wait...</font>

247
00:14:10,990 --> 00:14:13,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we do it thoughtlessly,
we'll just get creamed again.</font>

248
00:14:13,700 --> 00:14:15,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, what do we do?</font>

249
00:14:15,620 --> 00:14:17,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll use that thing.</font>

250
00:14:17,330 --> 00:14:18,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That thing...?</font>

251
00:14:24,420 --> 00:14:26,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look close at the movement
of the fish...</font>

252
00:14:27,260 --> 00:14:29,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aim for the instant when
they fall after jumping up.</font>

253
00:14:30,180 --> 00:14:31,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get hasty.</font>

254
00:14:33,010 --> 00:14:33,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

255
00:14:36,100 --> 00:14:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close!</font>

256
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:39,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more time, Naruto!</font>

257
00:14:40,020 --> 00:14:42,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get the Kunai knife,
so one more time!</font>

258
00:14:43,150 --> 00:14:44,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Master Kunihisa!</font>

259
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— It's deep over there!
— Please be careful!</font>

260
00:14:46,820 --> 00:14:48,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know, I know...</font>

261
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:52,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did it go?</font>

262
00:14:52,830 --> 00:14:54,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think it's in this area, but...</font>

263
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away this time!</font>

264
00:15:00,710 --> 00:15:02,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys...</font>

265
00:15:02,330 --> 00:15:06,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We hired these guys with
the money you threw away.</font>

266
00:15:06,630 --> 00:15:09,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It means that now,
they're on our side...</font>

267
00:15:09,550 --> 00:15:13,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you guys! I'll pay you double
what those guys did!</font>

268
00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:15,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So be on my side...</font>

269
00:15:15,970 --> 00:15:17,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?</font>

270
00:15:20,520 --> 00:15:22,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like you've run out of money.</font>

271
00:15:23,270 --> 00:15:27,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about you guys over there?
Wanna join us?</font>

272
00:15:28,150 --> 00:15:30,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll pay up stacks of money.</font>

273
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:33,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys have been
with me for a long time.</font>

274
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:35,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That paltry sum won't...</font>

275
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:39,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're not going along with
your selfish acts any longer!</font>

276
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:41,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys?!</font>

277
00:15:44,290 --> 00:15:46,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! I don't like it!</font>

278
00:15:46,460 --> 00:15:50,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Annoying brat. I'll have to tie you up
so you won't move.</font>

279
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:58,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing, Kunihisa?!</font>

280
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I... I...</font>

281
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's fine already!</font>

282
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:08,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you... I'll pay you double
what you get for your mission.</font>

283
00:16:09,030 --> 00:16:11,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Won't you hand that brat over to us?</font>

284
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:15,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're just going to demand
ransom money from his parents is all.</font>

285
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:19,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won't kill him.
Relax and hand him over.</font>

286
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:25,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not enough?
Here, how about this?</font>

287
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:26,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

288
00:16:27,380 --> 00:16:29,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kunihisa! Ride on my back!</font>

289
00:16:29,210 --> 00:16:30,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

290
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still not enough, huh? Here!
That's all of it! Take it!</font>

291
00:16:36,890 --> 00:16:38,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I said...</font>

292
00:16:39,930 --> 00:16:43,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a big mistake to think
you can obtain anything with money!</font>

293
00:16:44,100 --> 00:16:44,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

294
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:46,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After them!</font>

295
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen! Hold on tightly Kunihisa.</font>

296
00:16:51,190 --> 00:16:51,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

297
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:57,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! I can't move
with him on my back!</font>

298
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:06,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't see the bottom, Naruto...</font>

299
00:17:08,630 --> 00:17:09,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

300
00:17:13,420 --> 00:17:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! You go on ahead.</font>

